    "title_en": "Yang-Baxter deformed sigma models on $\\mathrm{SU}(N)/\\mathrm{SO}(N)$",
    "abstract_en": "We study Yang--Baxter deformations of two-dimensional sigma models on compact symmetric spaces $\\mathrm{SU}(N)/\\mathrm{SO}(N)$, with particular emphasis on their ultraviolet behavior. We claim that the ultraviolet fixed point is described by the $\\mathrm{SO}(N,\\mathbb C)/\\mathrm{SO}(N,\\mathbb R)$ non-compact WZW model together with $N-1$ compact free bosons. We determine the leading correction to this fixed point and identify it with the perturbation generated by the corresponding screening currents. We also extend our construction to the broader class of symmetric spaces of maximal rank.",
